 col←readStructColumn(vector column_type row_count);child_count;child_names;child_vectors;child_cols;i;ct;names;vals
⍝ Read a STRUCT column from a DuckDB vector
⍝ vector: the DuckDB vector pointer
⍝ column_type: the logical type of the column
⍝ row_count: number of rows
⍝ Returns: vector of namespaces (one per struct)

⎕io←0

child_count←api.duckdb_struct_type_child_count column_type
child_names←{256 read.utf8 api.duckdb_struct_type_child_name column_type ⍵}¨⍳child_count

child_vectors←{api.duckdb_struct_vector_get_child vector ⍵}¨⍳child_count
child_cols←⍬
:For i :In ⍳child_count
    ct←api.duckdb_vector_get_column_type(i⊃child_vectors)
    child_cols,←⊂readVector(i⊃child_vectors)ct row_count
    {}api.duckdb_destroy_logical_type ct
:EndFor

col←⎕NS¨row_count⍴⊂⍬
names←↑child_names
:For i :In ⍳row_count
    vals←{i⊃⍵⊃child_cols}¨⍳child_count
    col[i]⎕VSET names vals
:EndFor
